    "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Oedipodiella</b></i> is a genus of moss in the family Gigaspermaceae; it contains the single species <i><b>Oedipodiella australis</b></i>. This species is restricted to wooded areas of open grassland in South Africa, although a variety (<i>O. australis</i> var. <i>catalaunica</i>) is reported from Spain.",
